# Database Configuration:
# To connect directly to your XAMPP MySQL database without initDb:
# 1. Set DB_CLIENT=mysql
# 2. Make sure Apache & MySQL are running in XAMPP
# 3. Import 'cricket_db_updated.sql' in phpMyAdmin under database 'cricket_db'
